Package: BiocCitation
Title: Create CITATION File from PMID
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: This package creates a CITATION file from a unique DOI.
    It uses the 'rcrossref' package to retrieve the citation information.
    The package is intended to be used in the context of R packages.
